# astral: shortcuts are owned by the fork's ZenKeyboardShortcuts.mjs
# (Arc-style defaults); upstream's per-window CustomKeys conflict init is
# not registered so keys are not bound twice. ZenKeyboardShortcuts.sys.mjs
# stays installed only as a display helper (getShortcutDisplayFromCommand).
